      "SupplierProposalStatus": {
        "description": "**SupplierProposalStatus Enum:**\n\n| SupplierProposalStatus | Description |\n|------|------|\n| `CANCELLED` | A proposal that was previously submitted to a supplier, but was marked as canceled by the buyer before it was approved. |\n| `COUNTER_DRAFT` | A proposal that is undergoing negotiation with a supplier, a proposal that includes proposed deals has been received from the supplier, and the buyer has begun draft changes to the received proposal but has not yet submitted them to the supplier. |\n| `DRAFT` | A proposal that is in draft status, meaning that it may include changes that have not been submitted to a supplier. |\n| `PENDING` | The buyer has submitted a proposal to a supplier and is waiting for the supplier to take action. |\n| `REJECTED` | A proposal has been rejected by the supplier and negotiation has ended. No further changes may be done to a proposal nor may it be submitted again. |\n| `REVIEWED_PARTIAL` | Implies that some proposed deals in this proposal have been approved, while some proposed deals are in PENDING status. |\n| `REVIEWED` | A proposal in REVIEWED status implies that all proposed deals related to this proposal have been reviewed and further action by the buyer is required. The proposed deals associated with this proposal may individually be either approved or rejcted. |\n| `SUPPLIER_REVIEWED` | The supplier has reviewed the proposals and are awaiting buyer action. |\n",
        "enum": [
          "CANCELLED",
          "COUNTER_DRAFT",
          "DRAFT",
          "PENDING",
          "REJECTED",
          "REVIEWED",
          "REVIEWED_PARTIAL",
          "SUPPLIER_REVIEWED"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
